    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375640/extras/fb5908a4f7f351643af26c09a8ca9389.poster.avif?t=1744049790\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375640/extras/fb5908a4f7f351643af26c09a8ca9389.webm?t=1744049790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375640/extras/fb5908a4f7f351643af26c09a8ca9389.mp4?t=1744049790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Math has never been this action-packed! Step into <strong>Math Quest VR</strong>, where solving problems means blasting bandits with your paintball gun. Travel through exciting worlds of <strong>Addition, Subtraction, Multiplication, and Division</strong>, unlocking new challenges along the way. Whether you're playing <strong>Story Mode</strong> to level up your skills or testing your speed in <strong>Arcade Mode</strong>, every shot brings you closer to math mastery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve math problems in a whole new way</strong> \u2013 aim, shoot, and answer to progress through thrilling levels.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375640/extras/43f746a3846f0fdbcc049d8cdfb6ace8.poster.avif?t=1744049790\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375640/extras/43f746a3846f0fdbcc049d8cdfb6ace8.webm?t=1744049790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375640/extras/43f746a3846f0fdbcc049d8cdfb6ace8.mp4?t=1744049790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore interactive worlds</strong> themed around Addition, Subtraction, Multiplication, and Division.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375640/extras/f0cf24d393f9ea59b3d762d05b526415.poster.avif?t=1744049790\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375640/extras/f0cf24d393f9ea59b3d762d05b526415.webm?t=1744049790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375640/extras/f0cf24d393f9ea59b3d762d05b526415.mp4?t=1744049790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your challenge</strong> \u2013 level up in <strong>Story Mode</strong> or race against time in <strong>Arcade Mode</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sharpen your reflexes and your mind</strong> with fast-paced, brain-boosting gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in immersive VR action</strong> that makes math fun, exciting, and rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375640/extras/f8ee816481f977140506c015ada8bfe7.poster.avif?t=1744049790\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375640/extras/f8ee816481f977140506c015ada8bfe7.webm?t=1744049790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375640/extras/f8ee816481f977140506c015ada8bfe7.mp4?t=1744049790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think fast, shoot smart, and become a math legend in <strong>Math Quest VR!</strong><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375640/extras/fb5908a4f7f351643af26c09a8ca9389.poster.avif?t=1744049790\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375640/extras/fb5908a4f7f351643af26c09a8ca9389.webm?t=1744049790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375640/extras/fb5908a4f7f351643af26c09a8ca9389.mp4?t=1744049790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Math has never been this action-packed! Step into <strong>Math Quest VR</strong>, where solving problems means blasting bandits with your paintball gun. Travel through exciting worlds of <strong>Addition, Subtraction, Multiplication, and Division</strong>, unlocking new challenges along the way. Whether you're playing <strong>Story Mode</strong> to level up your skills or testing your speed in <strong>Arcade Mode</strong>, every shot brings you closer to math mastery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve math problems in a whole new way</strong> \u2013 aim, shoot, and answer to progress through thrilling levels.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375640/extras/43f746a3846f0fdbcc049d8cdfb6ace8.poster.avif?t=1744049790\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375640/extras/43f746a3846f0fdbcc049d8cdfb6ace8.webm?t=1744049790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375640/extras/43f746a3846f0fdbcc049d8cdfb6ace8.mp4?t=1744049790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore interactive worlds</strong> themed around Addition, Subtraction, Multiplication, and Division.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375640/extras/f0cf24d393f9ea59b3d762d05b526415.poster.avif?t=1744049790\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375640/extras/f0cf24d393f9ea59b3d762d05b526415.webm?t=1744049790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375640/extras/f0cf24d393f9ea59b3d762d05b526415.mp4?t=1744049790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your challenge</strong> \u2013 level up in <strong>Story Mode</strong> or race against time in <strong>Arcade Mode</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sharpen your reflexes and your mind</strong> with fast-paced, brain-boosting gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in immersive VR action</strong> that makes math fun, exciting, and rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375640/extras/f8ee816481f977140506c015ada8bfe7.poster.avif?t=1744049790\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375640/extras/f8ee816481f977140506c015ada8bfe7.webm?t=1744049790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375640/extras/f8ee816481f977140506c015ada8bfe7.mp4?t=1744049790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think fast, shoot smart, and become a math legend in <strong>Math Quest VR!</strong><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br></p>",
